{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2021-05-14 16:35:00', 'title': 'TYSON FOODS, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SPRINGDALE, ARK., MAY 14, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TYSON FOODS, INC. (NYSE: TSN), AT A MEETING ON MAY 11, 2021, DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.445 PER SHARE ON CLASS A COMMON STOCK AND $0.4005 PER SHARE ON CLASS B COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON SEPTEMBER 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPTEMBER 1, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2021-05-14 16:10:00', 'title': 'TYSON FOODS TO PARTICIPATE VIRTUALLY IN BMO FARM TO MARKET INVESTOR CONFERENCE', 'text': 'SPRINGDALE, ARK., MAY 14, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TYSON FOODS, INC. (NYSE: TSN) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WOULD PARTICIPATE VIRTUALLY IN THE 16TH ANNUAL BMO GLOBAL FARM TO MARKET CONFERENCE ON MAY 19, 2021. REPRESENTING TYSON FOODS WILL BE DEAN BANKS, PRESIDENT & CEO, DONNIE KING, CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER AND GROUP PRESIDENT, POULTRY, AND STEWART GLENDINNING, EVP & CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER.'}{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2021-05-14 06:30:00', 'title': "GENERAL MILLS CONTINUES PORTFOLIO RESHAPING STRATEGY WITH ACQUISITION OF TYSON FOODS' PET TREATS BUSINESS", 'text': "MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GENERAL MILLS (NYSE: GIS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE TYSON FOODS' (NYSE: TSN) PET TREATS BUSINESS FOR $1.2 BILLION IN CASH IN A TRANSACTION THAT PROVIDES AN ESTIMATED TAX BENEFIT OF $225 MILLION, EQUATING TO AN EFFECTIVE PURCHASE PRICE OF $975 MILLION. THE BUSINESS, WHICH INCLUDES THE NUDGES, TOP CHEWS AND TRUE CHEWS BRANDS, IS THE LEADER IN NATURAL MEAT TREATS FOR PETS. “THIS ACQUISITION ADVANCES OUR ACCELERATE STRAT"}{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2021-05-14 16:35:00', 'title': 'TYSON FOODS, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SPRINGDALE, ARK., MAY 14, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TYSON FOODS, INC. (NYSE: TSN), AT A MEETING ON MAY 11, 2021, DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.445 PER SH